Do not import anything under this tree as a standalone skill.

These SKILL.md files belong to the `docstore` PLUGIN. Claude Code loads them
through the plugin (namespaced `docstore:<skill>`). Copying or symlinking them
into .claude/skills/, ~/.claude/skills/ or ~/.agents/skills/ produces a DOUBLE
LISTING: the same skill offered twice, once namespaced and once bare, with
competing trigger descriptions.

Layout:  plugins/docstore/claude/   <- shared namespaced skills, commands and agents
         plugins/docstore/control/  <- shared governed MCP control server
         plugins/docstore/          <- explicit Claude/Codex plugin root

Claude consumes the slim package through its registered local marketplace.
Codex consumes the root package explicitly as `probata-docstore@probata` via
`plugins/.agents/plugins/marketplace.json`. The marker blocks only accidental
bare-skill scanning; it does not disable explicit plugin loading.

